<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= card.title %> - Decision Cards Game</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .breadcrumb {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .breadcrumb a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .breadcrumb a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .card-content {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 1.05em;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .action-btn {
            display: block;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }

        .view-results {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .view-results:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .locked {
            background: #ddd;
            color: #999;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }

        .locked:hover {
            transform: none;
            box-shadow: none;
        }

        .lock-icon {
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        .navigation {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            padding: 12px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover {
            background: #e0e0e0;
        }

        .home-link {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            background: #999;
            color: white;
        }

        .home-link:hover {
            background: #777;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            background: #ffeaa7;
            color: #333;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/stakeholder-cards">Stakeholder Cards</a> / Card <%= card.id %>
        </div>

        <h1><%= card.title %></h1>

        <div class="card-content">
            <p><strong>Detail about card...</strong></p>
            <p>This is placeholder text. You can fill in the actual details about this decision card here. What is the context? What decisions need to be made? What are the considerations?</p>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
            <% if (authenticated) { %>
                <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= card.id %>/results" class="action-btn view-results">
                    <span class="lock-icon">🔓</span>View Results
                </a>
            <% } else { %>
                <a href="/login" class="action-btn view-results locked">
                    <span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>Results Locked - Sign In First
                </a>
                <div class="status-badge">Complete the game before viewing results</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>

        <div class="navigation">
            <% if (prevId) { %>
                <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= prevId %>" class="nav-btn">← Card <%= prevId %></a>
            <% } else { %>
                <div style="grid-column: 1;"></div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (nextId) { %>
                <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= nextId %>" class="nav-btn">Card <%= nextId %> →</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <div style="grid-column: 2;"></div>
            <% } %>
            <a href="/stakeholder-cards" class="nav-btn">Back to Stakeholder Cards</a>
            <a href="/staff-cards" class="nav-btn">Go to Staff Cards</a>
            <a href="/" class="nav-btn home-link">← Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
